## spessasynth_core (MIDI clip synthesis)

`@tahti-player/audio-editor` uses spessasynth_core 4.3.22 (Copyright (c)
spessasus and contributors, https://github.com/spessasus/spessasynth_core) and
its dependency stb-vorbis 0.0.6 (https://github.com/spessasus/stb-vorbis), both
under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). They are loaded on demand to
render Multitrack MIDI clips.

No SoundFont file is bundled. MIDI clips play through the small saw-wave bank
that spessasynth_core generates in code (`BasicSoundBank.getSampleSoundBankFile`,
covered by the same Apache-2.0 licence). A SoundFont an artist loads from their
own device is used only in their browser session and is not distributed.

